==Special Moves==
===Soushou Shin===
{{FrameDataCargo-COTW
|moveId=hotaru_214A,hotaru_214C,hotaru_214AC
|input= 214A/C/AC
|input2= qcb+A/C/AC
|description3=* Hotaru's light chain ender and a general pressure tool.
*214A combos from lights but is always unsafe, 214C and 214A+C can be braked to become safe or +3 respectively at the cost of a slower startup.
*The meterless and metered versions actually have a different amount of hits, which makes a Guard Cancel DP feint punish difficult to pull off consistently.
*On top of that, the A+C version can be cancelled into other Rev Arts before the brake, which makes it so the only consistent way to punish Hotaru for abusing this move on block is a Guard Cancel Super, as slower/non-super reversals can get hit by a cancel to Rev Blow for enormous damage.
}}

