==Hidden Gear==
====Freeze Fang: Souhou Chihigiri====
{{FrameDataCargo-COTW
|moveId=hotaru_236236REV
|description=Side swaps after completion. Leaves you at +1 but spaced out. If used against a corned enemy, it leaves you cornered but in range for a meaty or command grab.
*Goes stupidly far in 6 frames with no travel time, so if you know your frame data you can use this to pick up punishes most characters can't hope for. This also means it's easy to combo into in juggles or grounded confirms, and it can work as an anti air.
*After the super, crouch A will beat 4f+ normals if they choose to attack (or jump), but conversions are limited.
*Instant Air Rev Blow covers many options they can do, losing mostly only to High Dodge Attack and supers.
}}

